+-- 1b. Drift assertion (statement 9 as scripts/apply_migrations.py counts: seven backups, the rewrite, this). The rewrite must have
+-- taken. json() of a non-JSON string raises "malformed JSON" and that generic error is all D1 reports: migration_runs and the
